# ── Vendored upstream Chatwoot (chatwoot/) ──────────────────────────────────
# The SOURCE is committed so our overlay can be reviewed as a diff against a
# known upstream release. Heavy NON-CODE assets are excluded to keep the repo
# pushable; the official Docker image ships them, and UPSTREAM.md records the
# exact upstream commit so the full tree can be restored byte-for-byte.
chatwoot/spec/
chatwoot/public/videos/
chatwoot/.github/screenshots/
chatwoot/vendor/db/*.onnx
chatwoot/tmp/
chatwoot/log/
chatwoot/storage/
chatwoot/node_modules/
chatwoot/public/packs/
chatwoot/public/packs-test/

# Local secrets for the Chatwoot stack — never commit.
chatwoot-cortoba/.env
